DESCRIPTION:6.15 pm to 9.30 pm\n\nPresentations and testimonials in the Tafel: 7.00 pm to 8.00 pm\nIntermission: 8.00 pm to 8.15 pm\nTHE POWER WE HOLD\, performed by YLTP graduates Asanda Hanabe and Zolani Mahola\, in the Star Theatre: 8.15 pm to 9.30 pm\n\nCanapes and refreshments are served. Meals are vegetarian.\nDress: cultural smart casual (traditional).\n\nRSVP: craig@artofliving.org.za by 31 October 2026
